# One IPv4 destination per line. These exceptions use Wi-Fi or Ethernet
# even when the selected VPN is disconnected. Remove a line to revoke it.
192.168.*
# A single public host or network can also be specified:
# 203.0.113.25
# 198.51.100.0/24

